WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:03,347
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:05,639
This is Episode 45.

3
00:00:05,689 --> 00:00:08,013
Maya has a lemonade stand.

4
00:00:08,063 --> 00:00:10,480
Her password is on a sticky note.

5
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,132
Right on the front.

6
00:00:12,182 --> 00:00:14,175
A muddy blob sees it.

7
00:00:14,225 --> 00:00:15,395
Oh no!

8
00:00:15,445 --> 00:00:17,521
Here comes the whisper jar.

9
00:00:17,571 --> 00:00:19,184
The note goes in.

10
00:00:19,234 --> 00:00:20,247
Pop!

11
00:00:20,297 --> 00:00:21,878
The lid shuts.

12
00:00:21,928 --> 00:00:23,912
The blob taps the lid.

13
00:00:23,962 --> 00:00:25,130
Nothing.

14
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,019
The stand leans in.

15
00:00:27,069 --> 00:00:29,084
The jar opens a crack.

16
00:00:29,134 --> 00:00:30,777
A tiny whisper.

17
00:00:30,827 --> 00:00:32,512
Then it closes.

18
00:00:32,562 --> 00:00:34,349
Only friends hear it.

19
00:00:34,399 --> 00:00:36,332
Now the jar shakes.

20
00:00:36,382 --> 00:00:37,694
New color.

21
00:00:37,744 --> 00:00:39,191
New secret.

22
00:00:39,241 --> 00:00:41,070
The old one is gone.

23
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,703
The blob comes back with the old note.

24
00:00:43,753 --> 00:00:44,777
Nope!

25
00:00:44,827 --> 00:00:46,077
Too late.

26
00:00:46,127 --> 00:00:48,091
Never on a sticky note.

27
00:00:48,141 --> 00:00:49,835
Always in the jar.

28
00:00:49,885 --> 00:00:51,849
That is the whisper jar.

29
00:00:51,899 --> 00:00:54,306
Now you know Secrets Manager!

30
00:00:54,356 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
